  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samoa Ports Infrastructure Investment Program - Samoa - Transport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AIFFP is supporting the Samoa Ports Authority with a dredging needs assessment for Apia Port and an update of the Samoa Ports Master Plan to enhance the efficiency of Apia Port operations. The port and harbour play a critical role for Samoa as the main international gateway facilitating economic trade activities for the nation and regional neighbours. The updated Port Master Plan is being produced by GHD Australia and will define the long-term development pathway for the port, addressing key aspects related to its future capacity, shipping activity, and resilience in the face of growing trade, tourism, and impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
